{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1dd30310-b94d-867d-ba0a-c727cc4644d7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T10:54:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:51:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Happy Monday, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:51:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, yes, good morning. I'm calling about the community room. Well, I want to book it for a birthday party."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:51:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can talk about that. Whose birthday is it, and about when are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:51:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, my daughter's. Well, I'm thinking a Saturday in April, mid-April maybe, afternoon, so like noon to three. And I'm sorry, I'm on speaker, I'm standing in line at the farm store for eggs, so if it gets noisy that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, I can hear you fine. Mid-April Saturdays, let me pull up the calendar. [pause] Okay, I'm showing a couple of Saturdays that look open that month. Do you have a rough headcount?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, about twenty-five. Maybe thirty with parents. Well, and that brings me to, is there an age limit? Like, do you have to be a certain age to book it, or does the party have an age limit for the kids?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. The person who signs the reservation has to be an adult, so that's you. There isn't a cutoff for the kids coming to the party, but the adults are responsible for supervising the whole time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay, that's fine. She's turning nine, so it's, um, kids and parents, nothing wild."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:52:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. For the actual reservation there's an application form. I can email it to you, or you can pick it up at the office. Which is easier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, email would be good. [crosstalk] Sorry, the person behind me, hang on. Yeah, email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll need your name and the address you want it sent to. Do you want to spell the email for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, can I call back with that? I don't have it in front of me. Actually, can you just call me? It's 401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, 401-555-0181. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Colleen Hanlon. H-A-N-L-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Colleen. I'll hold a tentative note for mid-April, and when we talk I'll go over the room rules and what's included, tables, chairs, that kind of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that sounds good. Um, will you call today, or?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll try to reach you this afternoon. If I miss you I'll leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:53:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks, Beth. Okay, I'm up next here. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:54:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now, enjoy the eggs!"
    }
  ],
